00:48:19.080 --> 00:48:20.080
Yeah.
对。

1021
00:48:20.080 --> 00:48:24.920
Like he's going he's going where like this is the part of you that fucked up this friendship.
就像他要攻击的是……这就是你搞砸这段友谊的根源所在。

1022
00:48:24.920 --> 00:48:25.920
Yes.
没错。

1023
00:48:25.920 --> 00:48:32.630
Punching in the face would be I'm going to cut out the middle man and go right to the source.
打脸的话就像是，我要省去中间环节，直接找到问题的源头。

1024
00:48:32.630 --> 00:48:36.830
And also is that the little literary flourish at the end, you know, putting you in a box
还有，这难道不是最后那点文学色彩的点缀吗，你知道的，把你塞进一个

1025
00:48:36.830 --> 00:48:38.990
of stuff I have no use for anymore.
装满我再也用不着的东西的箱子里。

1026
00:48:38.990 --> 00:48:41.110
Like it's really brutal.
这真的很残忍。

1027
00:48:41.110 --> 00:48:42.270
It's a brutal takedown.
这是一次残酷的击垮。

1028
00:48:42.270 --> 00:48:43.270
Yeah.
对。

1029
00:48:43.270 --> 00:48:48.310
And you really buy friendship over Barney Barney used to Barney like to throw around that that
而且你真的会相信“超越朋友”这种说法，巴尼以前总是

1030
00:48:48.310 --> 00:48:51.070
phrase as in just about minor things.
把这个词挂在嘴边，哪怕只是用来形容一些小事。

1031
00:48:51.070 --> 00:48:52.070
No.
不。

1032
00:48:52.070 --> 00:48:55.670
This is French opponent over but it's real and it's coming at Barney instead of saying
这次是“超越朋友”，但这可是来真的，而且是冲着巴尼来的，而不是

1033
00:48:55.670 --> 00:48:56.670
it's somebody else.
冲着别人去的。

1034
00:48:56.670 --> 00:49:00.470
And I think I think that Ted also is like looking back over the years of their friendship and
而且我觉得泰德也是在回顾他们多年的友谊，以及

1035
00:49:00.470 --> 00:49:05.350
all the ways that he did say yes, even begrudgingly even with a big eye roll.
他所有那些说“好”的时刻，哪怕是心不甘情愿地，哪怕是狠狠翻了个白眼。

1036
00:49:05.350 --> 00:49:06.350
Yeah.
对。

1037
00:49:06.350 --> 00:49:09.590
He went along with a lot of this guy's cockamamie plans.
这家伙那些荒唐透顶的计划，他其实都一路奉陪了。

1038
00:49:09.590 --> 00:49:12.070
He really did and Barney knows it.
他真的这么做了，巴尼心里也清楚。

1039
00:49:12.070 --> 00:49:17.830
And that is why we've never seen Barney sadder than the final moments of this episode.
正因如此，我们从未见过巴尼比这集最后时刻更难过的样子了。

1040
00:49:17.830 --> 00:49:21.510
And I think that God that I remember it just felt exciting.
而且我觉得，天哪，我记得当时就觉得这很刺激。

1041
00:49:21.510 --> 00:49:24.910
It felt like we have something to write about that's real.
感觉我们终于有了一些真实的、值得写的东西。

1042
00:49:24.910 --> 00:49:29.470
The life isn't all about, yeah, how much money can be described as a romantic comedy, but
生活并不全都是关于，没错，有多少钱可以被拍成浪漫喜剧，但

1043
00:49:29.470 --> 00:49:31.070
it is more than that.
它远不止于此。

1044
00:49:31.070 --> 00:49:34.990
And some of the worst heartbreaks come outside of the romantic realm.
而且有些最心碎的时刻恰恰发生在浪漫爱情领域之外。

1045
00:49:34.990 --> 00:49:41.190
So you have this like really deeply tragic ending, Barney is isolated, he's alone.
所以你得到了这样一个极其悲剧的结局，巴尼被孤立了，他孤身一人。

1046
00:49:41.190 --> 00:49:47.150
But then I'm just thinking like as a writer, you have a great vacuum that needs to be filled
但随后我作为一个编剧就在想，你迎来了一个需要填补的巨大真空，

1047
00:49:47.150 --> 00:49:51.310
a comic premise that presents itself, which is like who's Barney going to roll around with
一个自然而然的喜剧前提摆在了面前，那就是：巴尼以后

1048
00:49:51.310 --> 00:49:52.310
now?
要和谁厮混在一起？

1049
00:49:52.310 --> 00:49:53.310
Yeah.
对。

1050
00:49:53.310 --> 00:49:54.310
Like he needs a bro.
他需要一个兄弟。

1051
00:49:54.310 --> 00:49:57.710
And that will be discussed next week.
这将在下周进行讨论。

